      "observed": "The INA219AIDCNR symbol on the Power sheet has pin 8 labeled SDA and connected to I2C2_SDA_FCC, while pin 6 is labeled A1 and tied to GND. The standard INA219 pinout has pin 6 as SDA and pin 8 as A1.",
      "expected": "Per the INA219AIDCNR datasheet, pin 6 is SDA and pin 8 is A1. The schematic should connect I2C2_SDA_FCC to pin 6 and tie pin 8 (A1) to GND for address 0x40.",
